$ ctxt link list obj_1 --follow 3
→ [extends] obj_2
  → [supports] obj_3
    → [related-to] obj_4
    → [superseded-by] obj_7
$ ctxt link list obj_3 --follow 3
→ [related-to] obj_4
→ [superseded-by] obj_7
→ [supported-by] obj_2
  → [contradicts] obj_5
  → [extended-by] obj_1
    → [derived-from] obj_6
$ ctxt link list obj_3
  → [related-to] obj_4
  → [superseded-by] obj_7 (newer research)
  → [supported-by] obj_2
  ← [supports] obj_2
  ← [supersedes] obj_7 (newer research)
$ ctxt link list obj_3 --type supported-by
  → [supported-by] obj_2
$ ctxt link list obj_7 --follow 2 --type supersedes
→ [supersedes] obj_3
$ ctxt link list obj_6 --follow 1
→ [derived-to] obj_5
